{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1490494-tc-energies-colors-flux-psi-quantum-aether-etc","id":1490494,"title":"[TC] Energies Colors - Flux, Psi, Quantum, Aether, etc.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-17T01:48:35-07:00","id":1490494,"title":"[TC] Energies Colors - Flux, Psi, Quantum, Aether, etc.","content":"<b>If device or Energy-user use great forces of cosmos - what kind of color spectrum they fall for?</b><br /> <br /> <b>Jonnes </b>made fan char sheets for Roll20 and used A LOT of official books styles<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1490494-tc-energies-colors-flux-psi-quantum-aether-etc?p=1499669#post1499669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Flux</b> = <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><b>BLUE</b></span></span> - Sticky Energy<br /> <br /> <b>Quantum</b> = <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>YELLOW</b></span></span> - Plasma, Flames with <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Black</b></span> Particles (Taint)<br /> <br /> <b>Psi</b> = <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></b></span> - Liquid<br /> <br /> <b>Aether</b> = <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">BLUE (Flux) + Yellow (Quantum)</span> </span>= <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>GREEN</b></span></span> (I didn't think about the texture)<br /> <br /> <b>Telluric</b> = <span style=\"font-size:12px\">BLUE (Flux) + YELLOW (Quantum) + RED (Psi)</span> = <span style=\"color:#A9A9A9\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">WHITE</span></b> </span>- Radiant</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-01-2023, 03:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T02:10:12-07:00","id":1490495,"title":"","content":"I hope it\u2019s blue. The color of potential. Hopes of the skies, chaos of the waters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T03:14:38-07:00","id":1490500,"title":"","content":"I think Flux should be blue, for the reasons <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a> said and also as a counterbalance to Quantum being red.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T03:16:36-07:00","id":1490501,"title":"","content":"I guess you didn\u2019t understand the explanation for the green. It says the color have 2 dimensions, like X and Y in the graph. The X is the visible colors, Y is not visible with our eyes (kind like an imaginary axis). It\u2019s not RGB too, all colors RGB are between Red and Violet, you would need something like RGBx\u20ac\u00a3\u00a5 to describe this colors being \u20ac\u00a3\u00a5 3 different colors we can\u2019t see (like the color of the sound G minor or the color of the love of a mother for her child).<br /> <br /> The other energies happen to have a combination of coordinates that are not be visible while Aether is (luckly). Maybe a quantum or psi user can see those colors and than explain to us.<br /> <br /> And by they didn\u2019t point quantum or psi to any of the directions they just used the words in a certain order and said they are not visible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T12:46:47-07:00","id":1490529,"title":"","content":"I thought it was all Flux, underneath the surface, just \u2018filtered\u2019 differently. Quantum, subquantum, Inspiration: it\u2019s about the volume in which one channels it, with novas being the Kings of the Hill, so to speak?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T13:26:19-07:00","id":1490536,"title":"","content":"No. Quantum energies are primarily physical in nature; noetic energies are primarily mental. Each has some ability to manipulate the other, which is why you have Mega-Intellect and Biokinesis; but they are essentially different things. As for Quantum being the more powerful, it is the more powerful when it comes to physical manifestations; but Psi has a comparative advantage in the mental domain.<br /> <br /> Flux is something else entirely; it is, essentially, the flow of time. \u00c6ther is Flux contaminated by Quantum \u2014 or perhaps Quantum that has taken on Flux-like properties? It's a byproduct of using Quantum-based technology to break the barriers between worlds. The manuscript describes it as a sort of waste product, in fact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 08-17-2022, 05:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T13:50:43-07:00","id":1490540,"title":"","content":"My understand of Aether is something like:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Think Flux is the water in a river, flowing between realities, each margin is a different quantum field and so a different reality, with many rivers running side by side and spliting once in a while.<br /> A talent use his hands to direct some water (flux) to the side and you get the effects they can do, including dramatic edition. They can do a lot, but they cant move the river to the side.<br /> <br /> Than comes a Nova that could change the land beside the river but not cross it, and learn that there is a way to move the river using talent inspired tech.<br /> The Nova builds a bulldozer and start moving pushing the margin to cross to the other side. The water start splash all around from one river to the next and making all the land wet and muddy.<br /> Aether is the water going over and covering the land. An the Reality Engine is so big it can push water many reavers away.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 08-17-2022, 04:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T15:04:01-07:00","id":1490547,"title":"","content":"Thanks, everybody! You have been a fount of information! Everything you\u2019ve said in this thread has only served to make me more excited about the Trinity Continuum and it\u2019s various time period game lines!<br /> <br /> So, TC Aegis. Set in Ancient Greece? Do we know <i>anything</i>, other than that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T16:01:03-07:00","id":1490557,"title":"","content":"We know that it was inspired by a line in the original Adventure!, where Michael Donighal suggested that the Inspired may actually be the source of legends about heroes, wizards, and gods. TC:\u00c6gis is apparently going to be playing this up, with Talents being the heroes of that age; some sort of psiads being the mystics; and some sort of superhumans being the (demi?)gods. <br /> <br /> Even that much is conjecture at this point, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T16:35:36-07:00","id":1490561,"title":"","content":"Ooo! Interesting! Maybe in the Trinity Continuum, the mythologies of the world are distorted remembrances of superhuman beings doing superhuman things?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T16:37:54-07:00","id":1490562,"title":"","content":"And a TC Anima-specific question?<br /> <br /> What exactly do you play? Talents? Neutrals? Characters playing characters in an MMO? Or something completely new?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T18:01:27-07:00","id":1490569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1490494-tc-energies-colors-flux-psi-quantum-aether-etc?p=1490562#post1490562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And a TC Anima-specific question?<br /> <br /> What exactly do you play? Talents? Neutrals? Characters playing characters in an MMO? Or something completely new?</div> </div> </div> </div>Talents <i>with cyberware</i> playing characters in an MMO. A major theme of the setting is the blurring of identity; in particular, the dangers of an invasive technology that's capable of editing the user's mind. Said technology, a neural implant called Glass, is ubiquitous in the setting, and is what makes the MMO so incredibly immersive. It develops into a crisis, and is the reason why that technology is never seen in \u00c6on.<br /> <br /> Basically, Anima is a full on cyberpunk setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 08-17-2022, 09:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-17T18:11:05-07:00","id":1490571,"title":"","content":"Ok! Cool!, thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-14T12:00:59-08:00","id":1499669,"title":"","content":"Sorry about the necro.<br /> I have a pretty solid view on energy colors (which even reflects on the Roll-20 sheets).<br /> I believe the energy colors are based on the palettes in the books (except Core), so the colors and &quot;textures&quot; are:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Flux</b> = <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><b>BLUE</b></span></span> - Sticky Energy<br /> <br /> <b>Quantum</b> = <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>YELLOW</b></span></span> - Plasma, Flames with <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Black</b></span> Particles (Taint)<br /> <br /> <b>Psi</b> = <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></b></span> - Liquid<br /> <br /> <b>Aether</b> = <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">BLUE (Flux) + Yellow (Quantum)</span> </span>= <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>GREEN</b></span></span> (I didn't think about the texture)<br /> <br /> <b>Telluric</b> = <span style=\"font-size:12px\">BLUE (Flux) + YELLOW (Quantum) + RED (Psi)</span> = <span style=\"color:#A9A9A9\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18px\">WHITE</span></b> </span>- Radiant<br /> <br /> <br /> that's it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}